{"questions":[{"question_id":"0L67JQ4Hlh6dXi0w","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2013 (Offline)","year":2013,"examDate":2013,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"periodic-table-and-periodicity","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","topic":"ionization-energy","type":"mcq","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"permalink":"which-of-the-following-represents-the-correct-order-of-incre-2013-marks-4-0l67jq4hlh6dxi0w.htm","content":"Which of the following represents the correct order of increasing first ionization enthalpy for Ca, Ba, S, Se\nand Ar?","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"S &lt; Se &lt; Ca &lt; Ba &lt; Ar "},{"identifier":"B","content":"Ba &lt; Ca &lt; Se &lt; S &lt; Ar "},{"identifier":"C","content":"Ca &lt; Ba &lt; S &lt; Se &lt; Ar "},{"identifier":"D","content":"Ca &lt; S &lt; Ba &lt; Se &lt; Ar "}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"Those elements are present in periodic table like this -\n<br><br>\n\n<table class=\"tg\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <th class=\"tg-s6z2\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-s6z2\">Group 2</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-s6z2\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-s6z2\">Group 16</th>\n    <th class=\"tg-s6z2\"></th>\n    <th class=\"tg-s6z2\">Group 18</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">Period 3</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">Ca</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">..........</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">S</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">.........</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">Ar</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">Period 4</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\"></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\"></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">Se</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\"></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\"></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">Period 5</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\">Ba</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\"></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\"></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\"></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-s6z2\"></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>In periodic table,\n<br><br>1. From left to right ionization energy increases.\n<br><br>2. From top to bottom ionization energy  decreases.\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Ba &lt; Ca and Se &lt; S and S &lt; Ar\n<br><br><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Correct order is -\n<br><br>Ba &lt; Ca &lt; Se &lt; S &lt; Ar"}]}